r or the one designed for scenic vistas. There=E2=80=99s also, at least acc=
ording to our suggested Netflix titles, a chance there might be a murder my=
stery afoot.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Americans =E2=80=94 despite living in a natio=
n that has long prioritized driving while others invested in rail =E2=80=94=
 are increasingly choosing to travel via train.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Amtrak logged 34.5m customer trips and $2.7B =
in adjusted ticket revenue in FY 2025, a 10% increase from FY 2024, <a href=
=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWbCL48sBSndW3bMVkZ8-=
qV5wW4nNzqf5Jk5X1N50kgPF2-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3p9W1b7cN26mGhxJW5nTwCb24xzMbW1TZ0Wc=
