=3D"4Szd2Pa9" target=3D"_blank">25%</a> YoY in June 2025, the highest spike=
 since tracking began in 1989.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And that extra cash is often funding a demons=
trably worse experience:&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Seats have <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.c=
