isturbances</a>, many of which made national news and likely diminished con=
fidence in air travel.&nbsp;</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Not to mention, TSA has long been a hassle, w=
ith far more baggage restrictions than Amtrak, and a more laborious securit=
y screening process. Amtrak passengers can generally show up ~20 minutes be=
fore their train leaves, grab a coffee, and hop on.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
